Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:46:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Reserve published external sources and scope
 artifact staging to task board

Fix review P1/P2: share journal-aware ownership checks before holder reuse and return-home mutations; serialize published attach observation with initial registration under the writer lock, including replay. Stage selected snapshots under attachment_board(conn, task), not ambient board.

Proof: ownership RED 5 contract failures; board scope RED 2 assertions after correcting fixture helper name. Focused GREEN 43 tests; source regression 34 files, 587 passed; added fast-forward preservation coverage passed (7 ownership tests). Protocol advertisement remains 1.
